     _t_e_m_p_o_r_a_r_y flag is set, then it will cause removal of boot once configura‐
     tion, set by bbee__aaccttiivvaattee() function or by zfsbootcfg(8).  If the
     _t_e_m_p_o_r_a_r_y flag is not set, bbee__ddeeaaccttiivvaattee() function will set zfs canmount
     property to noauto.

     The bbee__ddeessttrrooyy() function will recursively destroy the given boot envi‐
